# FurnitureBench square table leg (200 mm), the dexsuite manipuland. Both lines are needed:
# make_instanceable stores the geometry payload in the Props/ sidecar, and a missing sidecar
# breaks only on a fresh clone -- the same way dg5f_my.usd did.
!source/isaaclab_assets/data/props/FurnitureBench/SquareTableLeg200mm/square_table_leg4_200mm.usd
!source/isaaclab_assets/data/props/FurnitureBench/SquareTableLeg200mm/Props/instanceable_meshes.usd

